1
00:00:06,006 --> 00:00:07,966
[beeping]

2
00:00:12,512 --> 00:00:14,514
[light music]

3
00:00:15,390 --> 00:00:19,019
[Riri] And so, the friendly, handsome,
and athletic Junta Hayami…

4
00:00:19,102 --> 00:00:21,438
[Junta] Uh, thanks for letting me stay.

5
00:00:22,147 --> 00:00:25,775
[Riri] …has now joined
Anzu's cozy coed living arrangement.

6
00:00:25,859 --> 00:00:26,693
[chuckles awkwardly]

7
00:00:27,318 --> 00:00:29,904
If you want to freshen up,
the bathroom is at the end of the hall.

8
00:00:30,947 --> 00:00:34,159
[Riri] This is a dream come true scenario.

9
00:00:34,993 --> 00:00:35,910
One more thing.

10
00:00:36,453 --> 00:00:38,913
Since this room only has two beds,

11
00:00:38,997 --> 00:00:40,040
would you guys mind--

12
00:00:40,123 --> 00:00:41,332
[Tsukasa and Junta] No way.

13
00:00:41,416 --> 00:00:42,792
Silly me.

14
00:00:43,293 --> 00:00:46,546
[Riri] It's just a matter of time
before the sparks of love fly!

15
00:00:47,255 --> 00:00:51,134
Well, in that case, we can move Kazuki
into my dad's office instead.

16
00:00:51,718 --> 00:00:53,136
Yeah, works for me.

17
00:00:53,636 --> 00:00:55,930
It'll be great to have a room with a desk.

18
00:00:57,390 --> 00:00:58,516
[meows]

19
00:00:58,600 --> 00:00:59,476
DAD'S SELECTION

20
00:00:59,559 --> 00:01:00,393
[dad] Yay!

21
00:01:00,477 --> 00:01:03,563
-[Riri] Welcome to the love castle!
-[all groan]

22
00:01:05,482 --> 00:01:06,900
-Um…
-Huh?

23
00:01:07,817 --> 00:01:11,112
[Junta] She's so pretty,
I can't even look her in the eyes.

24
00:01:12,113 --> 00:01:14,491
I'm late for practice.
But just let me know

25
00:01:14,574 --> 00:01:16,451
if I can help out with anything, okay?

26
00:01:16,534 --> 00:01:19,037
[soft chuckle]
We've got things handled here.

27
00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:20,163
Right.

28
00:01:23,124 --> 00:01:24,167
[sighs]

29
00:01:24,250 --> 00:01:26,503
Why is all of this happening to me?

30
00:01:27,504 --> 00:01:31,174
-Yeah, it's all too exciting…
-[Anzu] Get back here!

31
00:01:31,257 --> 00:01:33,384
You're gonna pay
for that underwear incident!

32
00:01:33,468 --> 00:01:34,594
[Riri] Give it up!
[grunts]

33
00:01:35,512 --> 00:01:37,472
-[Riri screaming]
-[loud thud]

34
00:01:37,555 --> 00:01:38,598
[Anzu breathes heavily]

35
00:01:38,681 --> 00:01:42,227
[Anzu] I can't believe how nonchalant
Mom is being about this whole thing.

36
00:01:42,852 --> 00:01:45,855
Tried to steal my underwear?
Well, I guess your old mom still got it.

37
00:01:45,939 --> 00:01:46,981
MOM'S SLIGHTLY-OFF REACTION

38
00:01:47,065 --> 00:01:50,318
[chuckles mischievously]
Meanwhile, there's good news.

39
00:01:50,944 --> 00:01:53,905
[Anzu] I got a part-time job
at the convenience store.

40
00:01:54,489 --> 00:01:56,157
Hi, welcome.

41
00:01:57,283 --> 00:02:00,453
[Anzu] Kazuki's always at work,
Junta's busy with baseball,

42
00:02:00,537 --> 00:02:02,539
I bet we'll barely see each other.

43
00:02:08,128 --> 00:02:10,130
[theme music]

44
00:03:33,880 --> 00:03:35,465
#6 A "REINCARNATED-
IN-ANOTHER-WORLD" DATE

45
00:03:35,548 --> 00:03:36,883
[Junta] Morning.

46
00:03:36,966 --> 00:03:39,427
-[Tsukasa] Hey.
-[Anzu yawns] Morning.

47
00:03:39,510 --> 00:03:41,846
Anzu, did you get up early
to make us lunch?

48
00:03:41,930 --> 00:03:42,805
Yup.

49
00:03:42,889 --> 00:03:44,641
Our housemother made me.

50
00:03:44,724 --> 00:03:46,392
Who are you calling "housemother"?

51
00:03:46,476 --> 00:03:49,854
It's fine. Now there
are three lunches for us to make,

52
00:03:49,938 --> 00:03:51,564
so I should help out too.

53
00:03:51,648 --> 00:03:55,401
[groans, snores]

54
00:03:55,485 --> 00:03:58,738
You offered to help.
And lettuce is not a pillow.

55
00:03:58,821 --> 00:04:00,865
Hey, do you mind if I watch?

56
00:04:00,949 --> 00:04:02,825
[Anzu] Watch?
I'll get nervous and mess up.

57
00:04:02,909 --> 00:04:04,535
[Tsukasa] Yeah, but it won't be his fault.

58
00:04:04,619 --> 00:04:06,120
You have no faith in me at all!

59
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:09,624
Fine, I'll show you. First, the pasta.

60
00:04:09,707 --> 00:04:11,542
You know you're boiling chopsticks, right?

61
00:04:11,626 --> 00:04:12,460
[yelps]

62
00:04:12,543 --> 00:04:15,546
-[Tsukasa] You're burning Mr. Octopus.
-[Anzu screams]

63
00:04:15,630 --> 00:04:17,632
[Tsukasa] And don't crack
the eggs on your forehead.

64
00:04:17,715 --> 00:04:19,467
-[Anzu yelps]
-[Tsukasa] You're hopeless.

65
00:04:19,550 --> 00:04:21,219
[indistinct chatter]

66
00:04:25,640 --> 00:04:26,557
Hm.

67
00:04:27,642 --> 00:04:30,895
Eh? What's the deal
with your lunch today? It's a mess!

68
00:04:30,979 --> 00:04:32,647
-I'm usually jealous.
-[gasps]

69
00:04:33,648 --> 00:04:35,858
Hmm. I know what's happening here.

70
00:04:35,942 --> 00:04:38,903
You had your old bestie make it for you!

71
00:04:38,987 --> 00:04:42,073
What, I-- No, it's not like that!
My little brother made it!

72
00:04:42,156 --> 00:04:44,450
You're stuttering! We know you're lying!

73
00:04:44,534 --> 00:04:47,078
Come on, this is so not fair.

74
00:04:47,161 --> 00:04:49,831
You get a girl who's cute
and she can cook.

75
00:04:49,914 --> 00:04:51,624
From the look of it, she can't cook.

76
00:04:51,708 --> 00:04:53,918
I told you my little brother made it!

77
00:04:55,003 --> 00:04:57,630
-Did she make him a lunch?
-Yeah.

78
00:04:57,714 --> 00:04:59,924
Wow, do you think they're dating?

79
00:05:00,717 --> 00:05:02,927
[sighs, chuckles]

80
00:05:05,138 --> 00:05:06,055
[camera clicks]

81
00:05:07,390 --> 00:05:10,184
Lies! If your little brother
did make it for you,

82
00:05:10,268 --> 00:05:12,312
why are you taking a picture
and smiling like that?

83
00:05:12,395 --> 00:05:16,024
-You sure look guilty.
-Hey, knock it off already!

84
00:05:16,524 --> 00:05:17,442
STEWS
SKEWERED KATSU

85
00:05:17,525 --> 00:05:18,526
[Tsukasa] Heading home.

86
00:05:19,027 --> 00:05:21,946
Kazuki, please,
work the front of the house?

87
00:05:22,030 --> 00:05:24,699
The customers love you.
What do you say, hmm?

88
00:05:24,782 --> 00:05:27,118
-No thanks, I'll pass.
-That's too bad.

89
00:05:32,415 --> 00:05:34,417
Kazuki, hey, wait up.

90
00:05:35,001 --> 00:05:37,420
Smart turning down the front-of-house gig.

91
00:05:37,503 --> 00:05:40,048
Not like you need any more fans, right?

92
00:05:40,131 --> 00:05:43,051
Hey, wanna hang out? There's a new café.

93
00:05:43,134 --> 00:05:46,345
We can grab a quick bite to eat
and maybe-- Uh?

94
00:05:48,181 --> 00:05:49,140
Goodnight.

95
00:05:50,516 --> 00:05:52,477
Okay, maybe next time.

96
00:05:54,812 --> 00:05:55,897
[Tsukasa clears throat]

97
00:05:58,316 --> 00:05:59,275
[exhales deeply]

98
00:06:00,943 --> 00:06:02,570
[Anzu] You're home! What took so long?

99
00:06:02,653 --> 00:06:04,572
[Anzu] We've been waiting for you
to start the show!

100
00:06:04,655 --> 00:06:07,075
Well, hey, whoa, what show?

101
00:06:07,158 --> 00:06:10,328
You forgot, huh?
The show Saki recommended. Come on.

102
00:06:11,662 --> 00:06:13,247
Hurry up, go take your bath.

103
00:06:13,873 --> 00:06:16,501
Well, don't take too long.
I'm falling asleep.

104
00:06:16,584 --> 00:06:18,336
You really don't have to wait.

105
00:06:18,419 --> 00:06:20,963
-It's more fun to watch together!
-It's more fun to watch together!

106
00:06:21,047 --> 00:06:22,298
-Uh…
-Jinx.

107
00:06:22,381 --> 00:06:23,549
Mm. Uh…

108
00:06:23,633 --> 00:06:25,259
[Junta] We said it at the same time.

109
00:06:26,844 --> 00:06:28,012
[chuckles]

110
00:06:29,806 --> 00:06:31,766
[water sloshing]

111
00:06:31,849 --> 00:06:33,351
[birds chirping]

112
00:06:33,434 --> 00:06:34,268
[door opens]

113
00:06:34,352 --> 00:06:36,187
-[Junta] I'm off to practice.
-[Tsukasa] Okay.

114
00:06:36,270 --> 00:06:38,314
[Anzu] Good luck today.

115
00:06:43,027 --> 00:06:44,320
You free later?

116
00:06:44,403 --> 00:06:45,530
Huh?

117
00:06:46,489 --> 00:06:47,824
[Tsukasa] I'll take that as a yes.

118
00:06:48,407 --> 00:06:49,951
I have to go shopping today.

119
00:06:50,034 --> 00:06:51,828
Would you like to come with me?

120
00:06:51,911 --> 00:06:53,913
[Anzu] Me? Yeah, I guess I can.

121
00:06:53,996 --> 00:06:55,331
Why not ask Makoto?

122
00:06:55,998 --> 00:06:58,876
-[Tsukasa] I did. He's busy.
-[Anzu] Okay.

123
00:06:58,960 --> 00:07:02,797
I guess I could.
But don't you normally shop alone?

124
00:07:02,880 --> 00:07:05,341
It's nice to have a shield
from other girls.

125
00:07:05,424 --> 00:07:08,261
Oh well, then I salute your hotness.

126
00:07:09,387 --> 00:07:11,722
[Anzu] Seriously, though,
I buy all my clothes online,

127
00:07:11,806 --> 00:07:13,724
so I don't really know
where to go around here.

128
00:07:13,808 --> 00:07:15,726
[Tsukasa] It's all right,
I know where to go.

129
00:07:15,810 --> 00:07:18,938
[Anzu] Can't you just shop online?
It's way easier.

130
00:07:20,731 --> 00:07:22,066
I prefer in person.

131
00:07:23,234 --> 00:07:24,402
Hmm.

132
00:07:26,362 --> 00:07:28,614
[Anzu] Okay, let me go change.
Be right back.

133
00:07:31,284 --> 00:07:33,202
-Let's go!
-[Tsukasa] Already?

134
00:07:33,286 --> 00:07:35,413
LAME

135
00:07:35,496 --> 00:07:37,498
[comical music]

136
00:07:37,582 --> 00:07:39,542
You didn't even change your shirt.

137
00:07:40,668 --> 00:07:43,212
Why change? This is a clean shirt.

138
00:07:43,296 --> 00:07:45,131
We're not going grocery shopping.

139
00:07:45,214 --> 00:07:47,592
The jeans are one thing, but that shirt…

140
00:07:47,675 --> 00:07:48,885
How's this one?

141
00:07:48,968 --> 00:07:50,720
[Tsukasa] Do you really not see it?

142
00:07:50,803 --> 00:07:52,096
How about this?

143
00:07:52,638 --> 00:07:54,474
[Tsukasa] All of your shirts
have cats on them?

144
00:07:55,016 --> 00:07:56,184
Let me decide.

145
00:07:56,267 --> 00:07:58,686
[screeches]
No, wait!

146
00:07:58,769 --> 00:08:01,772
Ah! I'm drying my underwear!

147
00:08:01,856 --> 00:08:02,690
[sighs]

148
00:08:02,773 --> 00:08:05,318
Even your underwear looks
like something a child would wear.

149
00:08:05,401 --> 00:08:08,112
-[meows]
-How dare you? These are adorable!

150
00:08:08,196 --> 00:08:11,157
Please get those out of my face.
This is getting weird.

151
00:08:12,408 --> 00:08:13,534
So, look.

152
00:08:13,618 --> 00:08:16,579
I assumed
that you have a variety of clothing…

153
00:08:20,333 --> 00:08:21,167
MEOW

154
00:08:21,250 --> 00:08:23,044
[Tsukasa] …but this is all you've got!

155
00:08:23,127 --> 00:08:25,922
What? And just
what is so wrong with these?

156
00:08:26,005 --> 00:08:27,965
[sighs] Do you have cash?

157
00:08:28,549 --> 00:08:31,135
Well, I've got
some holiday money left over.

158
00:08:31,219 --> 00:08:32,553
Planning on using it?

159
00:08:33,137 --> 00:08:35,806
No definitive plans, but,

160
00:08:36,849 --> 00:08:38,893
I was gonna buy games with it.

161
00:08:38,976 --> 00:08:40,061
[gasps]

162
00:08:40,144 --> 00:08:41,979
Let's buy you new clothes.

163
00:08:43,147 --> 00:08:44,232
Huh?

164
00:08:45,274 --> 00:08:47,485
[screams]

165
00:08:47,568 --> 00:08:49,487
It's fine to dress comfy at home,

166
00:08:49,570 --> 00:08:51,364
but get normal outfits to wear in public.

167
00:08:51,447 --> 00:08:52,782
Cats are normal!

168
00:08:53,282 --> 00:08:55,576
[Tsukasa] Wait, I just realized,

169
00:08:55,660 --> 00:08:58,579
you're gonna have to go out
shopping in these.

170
00:08:58,663 --> 00:08:59,747
[Tsukasa groans]

171
00:08:59,830 --> 00:09:01,958
[Riri] Sorry to interrupt,
couldn't help overhearing

172
00:09:02,041 --> 00:09:03,668
and I think I can help out!

173
00:09:03,751 --> 00:09:05,586
[screams]
You're still alive?

174
00:09:05,670 --> 00:09:07,004
-Huh?
-Leave it to me.

175
00:09:07,088 --> 00:09:09,715
I'll go help Anzu pick out
something super cute!

176
00:09:10,258 --> 00:09:12,843
Just hang tight
and we'll be down in a jiff.

177
00:09:14,595 --> 00:09:15,763
[chuckles]

178
00:09:15,846 --> 00:09:17,473
Now that my wand is all clean again,

179
00:09:17,557 --> 00:09:19,892
I can finally get back to using my magic.

180
00:09:20,518 --> 00:09:23,980
Wait, the underwear thief
was totally your doing, wasn't it?

181
00:09:24,063 --> 00:09:27,483
Yup! Had to cash in a favor
at headquarters for that one.

182
00:09:27,567 --> 00:09:29,652
[in deep voice]
Headquarters just made my list.

183
00:09:30,278 --> 00:09:33,281
Now, now, give us a smile,
you've got a big date.

184
00:09:33,364 --> 00:09:34,907
So, let's go get you dressed.

185
00:09:34,991 --> 00:09:36,867
We're going shopping, it's not a date.

186
00:09:36,951 --> 00:09:39,370
And I'm not going
if you're gonna be weird.

187
00:09:39,453 --> 00:09:42,957
Hey, stop being so mean
or I'm gonna throw everything away.

188
00:09:43,457 --> 00:09:44,625
Huh?

189
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:47,336
[Riri] All of this.

190
00:09:47,920 --> 00:09:49,547
Each and every outfit.

191
00:09:49,630 --> 00:09:51,632
[ominous music]

192
00:09:55,761 --> 00:09:57,305
-[Riri] We are ready!
-[Tsukasa] Huh?

193
00:09:57,388 --> 00:09:59,765
-[door opens]
-[Riri] The wait is over.

194
00:10:00,266 --> 00:10:02,268
-Here she is.
-[Anzu yelps]

195
00:10:02,351 --> 00:10:03,477
Ooh.

196
00:10:04,854 --> 00:10:07,481
[Anzu] Did I really have
to put on all this makeup?

197
00:10:08,190 --> 00:10:09,984
This is so embarrassing.

198
00:10:10,067 --> 00:10:12,069
[bright music]

199
00:10:12,153 --> 00:10:13,529
Uh…

200
00:10:17,658 --> 00:10:20,411
Sorry… to keep you waiting.

201
00:10:21,829 --> 00:10:22,747
It's fine.

202
00:10:23,247 --> 00:10:26,667
[Anzu]  Is it really hot in here,
or am I nervous?

203
00:10:26,751 --> 00:10:28,085
This is really exciting.

204
00:10:28,961 --> 00:10:30,546
-[Tsukasa] Let's go.
-Right.

205
00:10:31,130 --> 00:10:34,258
All dressed up like that. You look nice.

206
00:10:37,345 --> 00:10:40,181
[muffled grunt]

207
00:10:40,765 --> 00:10:41,932
What's with your face?

208
00:10:42,016 --> 00:10:44,477
[in deep voice]
I feel like I look weird in this.

209
00:10:44,560 --> 00:10:46,062
Your face is weird.

210
00:10:46,937 --> 00:10:48,856
[Anzu] Oh, man.
Here I am, all dressed up.

211
00:10:48,939 --> 00:10:51,067
-[Anzu] Hairdo and makeup…
-Anzu!

212
00:10:51,150 --> 00:10:53,361
New outfit counts as an expense.

213
00:10:53,944 --> 00:10:56,864
[Anzu] On my way
to go shopping with a hot guy.

214
00:10:57,448 --> 00:11:01,827
I am absolutely 100 percent
going on a date right now.

215
00:11:06,957 --> 00:11:08,959
[upbeat music]

216
00:11:09,960 --> 00:11:12,338
[indistinct chatter]

217
00:11:12,963 --> 00:11:16,467
[Anzu in deep voice] What am I
doing here? I usually just go online

218
00:11:16,550 --> 00:11:18,928
and get all the cute cat clothes
I can find.

219
00:11:19,011 --> 00:11:22,473
Everyone here is so stylish.
It's like another world.

220
00:11:22,556 --> 00:11:23,766
That face again?

221
00:11:23,849 --> 00:11:26,310
-This is how my face looks.
-It's ugly.

222
00:11:27,061 --> 00:11:28,646
[Anzu in normal voice]
Okay, that hurts.

223
00:11:28,729 --> 00:11:32,233
This place is packed.
Let's do this quickly.

224
00:11:33,692 --> 00:11:36,612
[Anzu] Kazuki, do you like hats?
I mean, 'cause you were wearing one

225
00:11:36,695 --> 00:11:38,864
when we first met
at the convenience store too.

226
00:11:39,573 --> 00:11:42,910
No, not really.
But it helps to hide my face.

227
00:11:43,452 --> 00:11:44,995
-Yeah, but…
-[girls murmuring]

228
00:11:45,079 --> 00:11:46,539
It doesn't seem to be working.

229
00:11:46,622 --> 00:11:48,290
[groans]

230
00:11:48,374 --> 00:11:49,667
So, why not wear a mask?

231
00:11:50,167 --> 00:11:51,127
[Tsukasa] I tried.

232
00:11:51,210 --> 00:11:54,088
Someone followed me home
thinking I was a celebrity.

233
00:11:54,171 --> 00:11:57,591
[Anzu] Well, I guess there's no hiding it
when you're that good-looking.

234
00:11:58,551 --> 00:12:00,970
[Anzu] Jeez,
he really hates being popular.

235
00:12:02,179 --> 00:12:06,142
I wonder if that's why he moved away,
to go to a different high school?

236
00:12:07,893 --> 00:12:09,979
[gasps, shivers]

237
00:12:10,604 --> 00:12:12,440
-[yells] Let the games begin!
-Huh?

238
00:12:12,523 --> 00:12:14,066
-[Anzu yells excitedly]
-Oh.

239
00:12:14,817 --> 00:12:15,818
Uh…

240
00:12:16,318 --> 00:12:18,320
[light music]

241
00:12:20,322 --> 00:12:22,241
[Anzu] Whoa! Kitty pajamas!

242
00:12:22,324 --> 00:12:25,703
It's cute! I want it!

243
00:12:35,504 --> 00:12:36,755
[Anzu] I can't believe it.

244
00:12:36,839 --> 00:12:40,551
I bought something with no cat on it?
No cat.

245
00:12:40,634 --> 00:12:43,012
-Is that a big deal?
-Huh?

246
00:12:43,596 --> 00:12:44,972
That's your first expense.

247
00:12:45,473 --> 00:12:46,932
[Anzu] This is not good.

248
00:12:47,016 --> 00:12:50,102
I let them dress me up
and I'm paying for a cute outfit

249
00:12:50,186 --> 00:12:52,480
that Kazuki chose for me.

250
00:12:52,563 --> 00:12:53,481
Yay!

251
00:12:53,564 --> 00:12:55,983
[Anzu] It's like I'm falling
into their trap!

252
00:12:56,066 --> 00:12:59,445
I'll show them. I'll only wear it
for special occasions!

253
00:12:59,528 --> 00:13:00,821
[moaning]

254
00:13:00,905 --> 00:13:04,033
[Anzu] I could never let Junta
see me in this.

255
00:13:04,617 --> 00:13:06,994
Hungry? Do you wanna grab a bite to eat?

256
00:13:07,495 --> 00:13:09,246
Sure, but…

257
00:13:09,330 --> 00:13:11,081
I have to go pee before that.

258
00:13:11,165 --> 00:13:12,625
Don't say "go pee."

259
00:13:13,209 --> 00:13:15,669
The bathroom was over there.
Be right back, okay?

260
00:13:15,753 --> 00:13:17,838
Sure, I'll find a place to eat.

261
00:13:17,922 --> 00:13:18,756
Uh.

262
00:13:19,340 --> 00:13:20,508
Oh, your bags.

263
00:13:23,469 --> 00:13:25,012
[chuckles]

264
00:13:28,182 --> 00:13:29,058
Hmm.

265
00:13:31,560 --> 00:13:33,562
-Hey, look at him!
-[sighs]

266
00:13:34,230 --> 00:13:36,482
[girl 1] Oh my, I wonder
if he's meeting up with someone.

267
00:13:36,565 --> 00:13:39,985
-[girl 2] Such a hottie.
-[girl 3] He's so handsome. Oh, my gosh.

268
00:13:41,654 --> 00:13:43,656
[sinister music]

269
00:13:45,032 --> 00:13:47,284
[breathing nervously]

270
00:13:48,494 --> 00:13:49,954
[Tsukasa] What's taking so long?

271
00:13:51,622 --> 00:13:52,581
[sighs]

272
00:13:53,541 --> 00:13:54,833
Wanna talk to him?

273
00:13:54,917 --> 00:13:56,418
Think he's got a girlfriend?

274
00:13:56,502 --> 00:13:58,462
Only one way to find out.

275
00:13:58,546 --> 00:14:01,465
[heart thumping]

276
00:14:02,383 --> 00:14:04,885
[Tsukasa] Oh, why do I have to wait
out in the open like this?

277
00:14:08,556 --> 00:14:11,350
Come on, hurry up and get back.

278
00:14:11,976 --> 00:14:14,979
Please, just leave me alone.

279
00:14:15,062 --> 00:14:17,856
-[heart thumping]
-[static]

280
00:14:21,151 --> 00:14:22,778
[female voice] Tsukasa…

281
00:14:23,279 --> 00:14:24,864
-[gasping]
-[heart thumping]

282
00:14:24,947 --> 00:14:26,156
[Tsukasa] Don't look at me.

283
00:14:28,284 --> 00:14:30,452
[female voice echoing]
Tsukasa…

284
00:14:30,536 --> 00:14:32,288
[gasps]

285
00:14:32,371 --> 00:14:33,455
[Tsukasa] Go away.

286
00:14:34,248 --> 00:14:35,416
Go away!

287
00:14:36,584 --> 00:14:37,626
[Anzu] Kazuki!

288
00:14:37,710 --> 00:14:39,086
[Tsukasa gasps]

289
00:14:40,963 --> 00:14:41,922
Huh.

290
00:14:45,467 --> 00:14:47,386
Sorry you had to wait,

291
00:14:47,469 --> 00:14:49,305
but I found the best store ever.

292
00:14:49,930 --> 00:14:50,764
Oh.

293
00:14:50,848 --> 00:14:52,182
[Anzu] Quick, come look!

294
00:14:52,266 --> 00:14:53,559
Huh?
[grunts]

295
00:14:53,642 --> 00:14:55,644
[gentle music]

296
00:15:02,109 --> 00:15:04,320
[Anzu giggling]

297
00:15:07,364 --> 00:15:10,534
How did I live my life before this?

298
00:15:12,202 --> 00:15:13,704
Thanks for inviting me along.

299
00:15:15,456 --> 00:15:16,290
[Tsukasa] Uh…

300
00:15:18,250 --> 00:15:19,335
[Anzu chuckles]

301
00:15:24,465 --> 00:15:25,466
It's been fun.

302
00:15:28,385 --> 00:15:30,220
Huh?
[yelps]

303
00:15:30,304 --> 00:15:32,431
[Anzu] It looks just like MomohikI!

304
00:15:33,140 --> 00:15:36,477
I want it, uh, but I spent all my money.

305
00:15:37,186 --> 00:15:38,520
I'll come back on payday.

306
00:15:39,021 --> 00:15:41,273
-I can buy it for you.
-[gasps]

307
00:15:41,857 --> 00:15:43,776
[Tsukasa] As a thanks for coming with me.

308
00:15:43,859 --> 00:15:46,278
Uh… Uh…

309
00:15:46,362 --> 00:15:47,279
MY GOD

310
00:15:47,363 --> 00:15:49,448
-[clerk] Thank you so much!
-[Anzu] Thank you so much!

311
00:15:52,534 --> 00:15:54,912
[Anzu gasping]
It's so cute!

312
00:15:54,995 --> 00:15:58,832
I love it so much.
I promise to take great care of it.

313
00:15:58,916 --> 00:15:59,917
Okay.

314
00:16:01,835 --> 00:16:03,921
Damn, it's later than I thought it was.

315
00:16:04,004 --> 00:16:05,923
-[tires screeching]
-[both] Huh?

316
00:16:06,715 --> 00:16:07,716
Anzu?

317
00:16:10,678 --> 00:16:13,472
-Wow, you change your look.
-[soft chuckle]

318
00:16:13,555 --> 00:16:14,890
It's all Riri.

319
00:16:16,266 --> 00:16:18,852
It must be new. And there are no cats.

320
00:16:19,895 --> 00:16:21,480
[Junta] She looks so cute.

321
00:16:21,563 --> 00:16:23,857
How long have you been wearing cats
on all your clothes?

322
00:16:23,941 --> 00:16:28,404
-Uh, did you two go somewhere?
-Yeah, picked up some new clothes.

323
00:16:28,487 --> 00:16:30,322
No!

324
00:16:30,406 --> 00:16:31,490
[Junta] Not fair, not fair…

325
00:16:31,573 --> 00:16:34,326
-[Tsukasa] Stop looking at me like that.
-Not fair, not fair, not fair, not fair…

326
00:16:34,410 --> 00:16:36,078
That was a long practice.

327
00:16:36,161 --> 00:16:38,580
Bet you're starving.
Does teriyaki sound good?

328
00:16:38,664 --> 00:16:40,457
Heck, yeah! Sounds great.

329
00:16:40,541 --> 00:16:43,002
I'll start making dinner
as soon as we get home.

330
00:16:43,085 --> 00:16:44,086
Can't wait.

331
00:16:44,169 --> 00:16:45,295
[Anzu chuckles]

332
00:16:46,755 --> 00:16:49,883
[Anzu] I was worried
Riri would spend the whole day meddling,

333
00:16:49,967 --> 00:16:52,678
but it actually turned out
to be pretty peaceful.

334
00:16:53,303 --> 00:16:55,848
Hey, wanna watch our show while we eat?

335
00:16:56,473 --> 00:16:57,307
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

336
00:16:57,391 --> 00:16:58,559
-Huh?
-Um…

337
00:16:58,642 --> 00:16:59,727
[both chuckle awkwardly]

338
00:17:00,394 --> 00:17:04,314
[Anzu] I can't wait to see what happened
after the zombies caught them.

339
00:17:04,398 --> 00:17:06,316
It's gonna be so good!

340
00:17:07,901 --> 00:17:09,903
[suspenseful music]

341
00:17:16,994 --> 00:17:20,706
-[screaming]
-[zombie snarling]

342
00:17:20,789 --> 00:17:23,292
[Anzu screams]
That thing! It's back!

343
00:17:23,375 --> 00:17:24,918
IT'S SUPER GROSS,
WE DISGUISED IT AS A CAKE

344
00:17:25,002 --> 00:17:28,172
Kazuki, kill it! Kill it now!

345
00:17:28,255 --> 00:17:29,465
Not again.

346
00:17:29,548 --> 00:17:32,468
IT'S SUPER GROSS,
WE DISGUISED IT AS A CAKE

347
00:17:32,551 --> 00:17:34,970
Hey, Junta, help me lift the couch.

348
00:17:35,554 --> 00:17:37,639
-[whimpers]
-[Tsukasa] What?

349
00:17:39,016 --> 00:17:40,309
[thuds]

350
00:17:42,936 --> 00:17:45,022
Fine, I'll just get it myself!

351
00:17:45,522 --> 00:17:47,149
-[grunts]
-[splats]

352
00:17:54,448 --> 00:17:56,784
Man, I'm glad you're here.

353
00:17:57,951 --> 00:18:01,789
Kazuki, I know moving in so quick
was kinda nuts,

354
00:18:01,872 --> 00:18:04,666
but you've been a lifesaver for me.

355
00:18:07,961 --> 00:18:10,547
[Junta] Unlike me,
I'm sorry I'm so useless.

356
00:18:10,631 --> 00:18:13,967
Not true, Junta,
you caught that awful panty thief!

357
00:18:14,051 --> 00:18:16,929
[Junta] I can't even protect you
from a bug.

358
00:18:17,012 --> 00:18:19,473
[Anzu] Hey, no,
those things are the worst.

359
00:18:20,224 --> 00:18:22,810
There. See?

360
00:18:22,893 --> 00:18:24,895
[light music]

361
00:18:24,978 --> 00:18:27,064
Maybe I'm the one who's being saved.

362
00:18:35,364 --> 00:18:36,406
[sighs]

363
00:18:37,407 --> 00:18:39,993
[Anzu] So far, the sleeping arrangements
have been kinda nice.

364
00:18:40,077 --> 00:18:41,995
Might just work out after all.

365
00:18:46,041 --> 00:18:47,501
[chuckling]

366
00:18:48,418 --> 00:18:51,505
Oh no, I wouldn't get
so comfortable just yet.

367
00:18:51,588 --> 00:18:54,716
I still have one more player for our game.

368
00:18:55,551 --> 00:18:57,970
[birds chirping]

369
00:18:58,053 --> 00:19:00,973
[snoring]

370
00:19:06,145 --> 00:19:07,271
Wake up!

371
00:19:07,771 --> 00:19:11,024
[gasps, screams]

372
00:19:11,650 --> 00:19:13,777
Kazuki? Why are you in my room?

373
00:19:13,861 --> 00:19:16,029
Well, I tried shouting from downstairs,

374
00:19:16,113 --> 00:19:17,447
but you were out cold.

375
00:19:17,531 --> 00:19:19,116
But my alarm…

376
00:19:19,199 --> 00:19:20,367
Oh crap!

377
00:19:20,450 --> 00:19:22,911
Just go! Go on without me!

378
00:19:22,995 --> 00:19:24,955
-Yeah, I wasn't planning on waiting.
-[whimpers]

379
00:19:25,038 --> 00:19:26,081
[door closes]

380
00:19:26,165 --> 00:19:28,125
[Anzu] I've never overslept for school!

381
00:19:28,208 --> 00:19:30,169
[pants, grunts]

382
00:19:30,252 --> 00:19:34,840
How did this happen? I'm so screwed!

383
00:19:35,674 --> 00:19:38,552
[breathing heavily]

384
00:19:38,635 --> 00:19:41,054
Oh no, I'm gonna be late!

385
00:19:41,638 --> 00:19:44,892
[Anzu] Wait. What did I just say?

386
00:19:44,975 --> 00:19:46,560
That phrase…

387
00:19:46,643 --> 00:19:49,646
It sounded so familiar.

388
00:19:50,189 --> 00:19:52,566
I'm gonna be late!

389
00:19:52,649 --> 00:19:54,443
[panting]

390
00:19:54,526 --> 00:19:55,485
[both grunt]

391
00:19:55,569 --> 00:19:58,864
[Anzu] This is way too similar
to one of those dating sim scenarios.

392
00:20:00,157 --> 00:20:03,535
There's no chance
a third guy shows up, right?

393
00:20:03,619 --> 00:20:07,039
I'm coming up on the corner.
You don't think…

394
00:20:07,623 --> 00:20:08,665
Nah, there's no way.

395
00:20:08,749 --> 00:20:12,085
I'm not even running with toast
in my mouth, so--

396
00:20:12,169 --> 00:20:13,921
-[thuds]
-[screams]

397
00:20:14,963 --> 00:20:16,173
[grunts]

398
00:20:16,673 --> 00:20:21,678
[Anzu] Uh, it was just a car,
not another cute boy. I'm safe.

399
00:20:21,762 --> 00:20:23,972
Wait! That car just hit me!

400
00:20:24,473 --> 00:20:26,016
[groans]

401
00:20:26,099 --> 00:20:28,936
[man] I'm terribly sorry, miss.
Are you hurt?

402
00:20:29,019 --> 00:20:30,020
[moans]

403
00:20:30,103 --> 00:20:32,105
[gentle music]

404
00:20:34,983 --> 00:20:36,068
Uh…

405
00:20:36,985 --> 00:20:38,904
I'm fine. Not even a scratch.

406
00:20:39,821 --> 00:20:43,492
[Hijiri] She's the one who went running
out into the street right in front of us.

407
00:20:43,575 --> 00:20:47,079
There's absolutely
no need for us to apologize to her.

408
00:20:47,162 --> 00:20:49,164
[dreamy music]

409
00:20:51,083 --> 00:20:53,710
You're the one
with the toast in your mouth?

410
00:20:54,253 --> 00:20:55,796
[exhales deeply]

411
00:20:57,381 --> 00:21:00,092
[munching]

412
00:21:02,010 --> 00:21:03,679
A fanfare, please!

413
00:21:03,762 --> 00:21:06,098
And a big congratulations!

414
00:21:06,181 --> 00:21:08,141
Did you fall for my little trick?

415
00:21:08,225 --> 00:21:11,061
I bet now you don't feel like
skipping the ending, right?

416
00:21:11,144 --> 00:21:14,815
In today's world, you can watch
whatever you want at your own convenience.

417
00:21:14,898 --> 00:21:17,567
But don't you think in that process
we've also lost something?

418
00:21:17,651 --> 00:21:20,195
[sighs]
Don't just let things be! Come on!

419
00:21:20,279 --> 00:21:22,698
Let's go on a super-duper happy adventure!

420
00:21:22,781 --> 00:21:24,616
So I can make sure I get paid.

421
00:21:24,700 --> 00:21:26,868
[closing theme music]

422
00:21:26,952 --> 00:21:27,786
♪ Ah, yeah! ♪

423
00:21:30,414 --> 00:21:31,248
♪ Let's go! ♪

424
00:21:33,583 --> 00:21:34,918
♪ Lo-love! ♪

425
00:21:36,503 --> 00:21:37,838
♪ Here we go! ♪
